Monk Skin Tone scale
--------------------
The ten levels of `core.skin-tone` (mst-1 ... mst-10) follow the Monk Skin Tone (MST) scale,
developed by Dr. Ellis Monk (2019) and released by Google under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0). The scale is credited here as the reference
the ten levels follow. No colour swatch, value, image or text of the publication is copied into
this pack; the level names and their words are MineWorld's own.

Population data sources (DEP-68)
--------------------------------
The realistic ranges and the population profiles that pair with this catalogue are read from:

- U.S. Census Bureau, American Community Survey (ACS) — including table B03002, whose
  categories the values of `core.ancestry` follow.
- U.S. Centers for Disease Control and Prevention (CDC), National Health and Nutrition
  Examination Survey (NHANES).

No figure from either source is stored in this pack; the figures live in the population
profiles (entities/populations-us), with their citations.
